** 15/07/26 **

	-> docker compose : 
		- docker compose up -d
		- docker compose stop
		- docker compose down
		- docker compose -f <docker-compose.yml> logs
		- nohup docker attach <container_id> &
		
	-> docker registry :
		- docker image tag <img_name:tag> <dockerhub_user_name/new_img_name:tag>
		- docker push <img_name>
		
	-> multi-stage docker build :
		- can create image with small size using smaller version to run that image and use previously defined big version only for downloading requirements 
		- path of the requirements = /usr/local/lib/python3.9/site-packages
		- in Dockerfile use = COPY --from=<alias_name_of_big_version> <requirements_path> <requirements_path> 
		
	-> scale :
		- used for testing n all
		- used to run same container multiple times on diff ports
		- add in docker compose file = scale: 3
		- remove container name from docker compose file because it will create its own
		- increase the host port range (5000-5003:5000)	
	
	
	
	
	
	
